<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Vodni Stavby approves CZK 27 div.</title>
<headline>Czech Vodni Stavby approves CZK 27 div.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A general shareholders' meeting of Prague-based construction group Vodni Stavby Praha a.s. on Tuesday approved a gross dividend on 1996 profits of 27 crowns, down from 45 crowns the previous year, the company said.  </p>
<p>Further details were not yet available.</p>
<p>The company had announced earlier this year net 1996 profit of 100.03 million crowns after 169.5 million crowns the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
